title: "Conjectura: AI-driven mathematical discovery"
abstract: >-
  Research infrastructure and ongoing investigations for AI-driven mathematical
  discovery through computational experimentation, autonomous research agents,
  symbolic reasoning, and formal verification. The repository documents the
  respective contributions of AI systems and human researchers; see
  docs/attribution-policy.md.
